WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.550
What's up, Tsuyoponnu?

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.980
Looks like I'm going to the beach
with Na-chan and the guys on the 5th.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.640
Seriously?!

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.320
I wanna go, too!

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.740
But you haven't finished your costume yet.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:16.990
I'll make it work somehow.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.440
It's just one day.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.680
In that case, shouldn't you
get some sleep instead?

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.370
You're talking like I'm
a pain to have around...

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.800
I was trying to be nice.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:28.960
Bathroom.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.920
I wanna go to the beach, too!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.040
That's it!

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:16.390
Let's swim!

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:17.920
It's so hot...

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:19.870
Let's set up a beach parasol first.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:23.300
I'm not moving from here.
You can leave your stuff with me.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.470
Really?!

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:26.550
Why did you even come here?

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.960
To enjoy the ambiance.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:36.780
Mattsun, aren't you going?

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.810
Oh, I'm going. To pick up girls!

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:41.320
Just don't bring them back here.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.690
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:47.230
Tsuyoponnu!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.320
Huh? Yukirin?

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:51.240
Why are you here?

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.250
We were coming here, too!

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:56.350
And it just coincidentally
happened to be on the same day!

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.450
Coincidentally?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.820
Who's the "we"?

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.120
Your school friends?

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:01.930
Nope.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:03.600
Girls from another school.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:04.880
Over here!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.030
Oh, Naoe-kun.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.900
I knew it! Too many guys here...

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:11.380
Huh? You brought Kobayakawa-san
and her friend?

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.720
Yup! It's the three of us!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.010
Leave your stuff here.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:19.020
You're not mad! You're so nice!

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.480
There's nothing I can do
when you're already here.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:24.100
I'm going home.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.630
What? Why?

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.810
Let's play!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:29.610
I only came because of Anna!

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.280
Why are these jokers here?!?

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.450
They make me sick! I'm gonna puke!

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:35.820
We were here first!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.870
<i>Then you can leave first, too!</i>

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.740
Someone's making a fuss over there...

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.750
<i>I said we're not leaving.</i>

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:43.490
<i>Then get out of my sight!</i>

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.170
Hey... there are more people now.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.790
It's Kobayakawa-san and friends!

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.710
Na-chan!

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.250
Tsuyopon!

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.550
Could you get me a towel?

00:03:58.020 --> 00:03:59.720
Na-chan? What happened?

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.410
He drowned?

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.300
Hey! Na-chan!

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.880
Natsuking!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:10.180
Hashiba-kun.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.360
Hashiba-kun? Are you okay?

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:19.700
Y-Yes! I'm okay!

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.050
Thank goodness.

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.630
I didn't expect you to come here.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:29.600
Well, I was so surprised, I nearly drow—

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.820
I doubt he'll be able to talk to her like that.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:40.370
Well, since we're all here,

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:42.030
let's play some beach volleyball!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:42.970
Sounds good!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.680
What? It's hot...

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.430
Count me out.

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.850
Anna and I are gonna get some yakisoba.

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.280
I'll play.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.610
I should have known!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.760
Marippe, you join in, too!

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:56.590
If I'm on Anna's team...

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.900
Don't look at me, you creepy scumbag!

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:00.200
I'm not looking!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:03.310
And why aren't you in a swimsuit?
Those are just regular clothes!

00:05:03.310 --> 00:05:03.320
<i>Like I'd ever wear a swimsuit, you perv!</i>

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.890
Na-chan, are you in?

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:07.120
There!

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.870
Huh? There's hardly any left.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.100
I drank it.

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:13.940
Well, I'll go buy something, then.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:16.090
Grab stuff for the rest of us, too.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:16.780
Sure.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.540
Yukirin, do you know where the bathrooms are?

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.420
To the left, around the back.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:23.510
Thanks.

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:26.390
Anna? Where're you going?

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:27.180
Out back.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:28.890
I'll come, too!

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:31.550
Whoa! You're way too close, Creepy!

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:32.770
Want to grab some yakisoba?

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:33.980
And I'm not creepy.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.550
Huh?! I'm not eating anything with you!

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:38.780
Come on. It'll be my treat.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:39.880
No way!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.040
Anna!

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.670
Tsuyoponnu, are you feeling hot?

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.320
Want some shaved ice?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.910
Yeah, that would be good.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:47.740
Yukirin, go buy—

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:48.790
Let's go together!

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.940
Natsuking, watch our stuff!

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.670
Hashiba-kun...

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:00.090
It's just you?

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.140
Looks like it.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.350
May I join you?

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:07.200
Go ahead.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.590
Go for it, Na-chan.

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:16.820
How far do you intend to drag me?

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.400
Ow! That hurt!

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:19.970
Yeah, it was supposed to hurt!

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.440
You violent woman.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.990
Shut up. I'm going back.

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:24.070
You can't!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.910
Why not? Let go!

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:29.080
We're giving Natsuki and
Kobayakawa-san some space.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.920
Now I have to go back!
I'm definitely going back!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:35.090
Do you like Kobayakawa-san that much?

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:36.860
Of course I do!

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.760
I told you that before.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.490
Enough! Let go, already!

00:06:42.490 --> 00:06:43.590
Come on, hear me out!

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:48.920
Hypothetically...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.220
Nice weather we're having, huh?

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.300
Yeah. It's hot today.

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:01.780
S-Sorry to ask this when it's so hot,

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:04.670
but could you put your jacket back on?

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:06.950
Sure.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:10.830
It'd help if you wrapped a towel
around your waist, too.

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.980
I can't even look in your direction.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.170
Oh, I see.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.670
Sorry that I'm unsightly.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:20.800
I'll cover up with a towel.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.190
No, that's not it!

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:25.580
That looks great on you!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.510
You're not unsightly at all!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.070
Really?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.470
Well... Uh, yeah.

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.350
Thank goodness.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.640
The truth is, I don't own a swimsuit,

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.010
so I asked Mari-chan,

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.090
and she picked out one
she thought would suit me.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:40.820
Oh, I see.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.020
Is it weird?

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.990
No, not at all.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:48.100
You could say I just can't bear to look...

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.660
That's on me, though.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.130
Because I'm in a swimsuit?

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:54.020
But there are lots of people dressed like this.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:57.210
No, I'm fine looking at other people.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.810
You could say that you're... special.

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:00.590
Um...

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.710
Special?

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:04.570
How am I special?

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:06.130
Why?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.800
Um, w-well...

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.640
Why, you ask? It's because...

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.540
I... I...

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.610
Kobayakawa-san,

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:19.940
I'm in lo—

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:20.870
Oh.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.180
How does it look, Tsuyoponnu?

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.420
Na-chan got hit with a ball. I think that's all.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.630
Doesn't seem like much will happen.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.950
Aww! Too bad!

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.830
Yukirin, you noticed?

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:36.580
Yup!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.600
Natsuking makes it pretty obvious!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.590
That's true.

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:44.580
Okay, go ahead.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.040
Go ahead and do what?

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:47.930
You can't mean...

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:49.760
Yes, I do.

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.810
I don't want to do it with people around.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:54.180
We have fans! It'll be fine!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.970
Come on, let's do it already! Hurry up!

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.940
Oh, fine, I guess.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.820
It is summer.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.920
Hypothetically...

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.370
...is there room for me, too?

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.160
What are you saying?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:15.590
You know.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:18.830
I'm saying, why just women?
Give men a chance, too.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:22.190
In other words, not only do you mock me,

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:25.000
you also don't realize how cute Anna is?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.420
Huh? No, that's not what...

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.970
Seriously, drop dead!

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.160
Get bent!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.800
Ow!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:35.270
Ow...

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:38.690
You okay?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.020
Uh, yeah.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.440
You're bleeding!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.110
I stepped on the glass.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:48.730
Barefoot? Where's your sandal?

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.280
It broke.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.240
You'd better wash that, or it'll get infected.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.040
Use this...

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.960
It's fine! No need to waste that!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.360
Don't worry about it.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:58.310
May I pour it on you?

00:09:58.310 --> 00:09:58.950
Yes.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:00.790
This might sting a bit.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:02.960
Ow!

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.770
Oh, did that hurt? Does it sting?

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:05.750
Yes.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.400
But, I'm fine.

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:08.880
Ow...

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.890
Ow!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.750
That really does hurt.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.810
Did I pour too much on?

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.020
I'm sorry.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:19.520
It was entertaining, so I kept going...

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:21.460
Entertaining...?

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:23.230
Oh, it's nothing.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.120
Are you here with friends?
Can you make it back to them?

00:10:26.120 --> 00:10:28.520
Yes, I'll hop.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.190
Thank you!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.220
Thank you very much.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.750
No problem. Take care.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.240
Um...!

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.380
What is... your name?

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.210
My name?

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:48.930
Yes!

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:50.600
Keiichi Katakura.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.720
Bye now.

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:57.720
Katakura... Keiichi-san.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.990
Piggyback! He gave her a piggyback ride!

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:03.650
I feel like I've seen her somewhere...

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.230
We did a pretty nice job.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.320
Yeah, it looks really cool.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.210
I think I'll snap a picture.

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:14.310
Me, too!

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.430
Whose is this, again?

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:21.040
Mine.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:22.430
Hey, guys!

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.120
Let's take a group photo!
